          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku mwenga afuasi a Jesu kama atu gana mwenga na mirongo miiri kala akakutana phamwenga. Phahi Petero waima achigomba nao achiamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Enehu, kala ni lazima Maandiko ga Mlungu gatimizwe. Hipho kare Mfalume Daudi walongozwa ni Roho Mtakatifu achigomba chimbere maneno ambago gamphaha Juda. Iye kala ni myawehu, mana piya naye kala akatsambulwa kuhenda kazi phamwenga, ela wakala chilongozi wa atu ariomgbwira Jesu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.16+ACT.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.16",
              "ACT.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
