        {
          "text": "Phahi Petero achienderera kugomba, achiaambira, “Kpwa mana Chitabu cha Zaburi chaandikpwa, ‘Nyumbaye naitsamwe; asisagale mutu yeyesi mumo.’ Na tsona ichiandikpwa, ‘Na cheoche nachihalwe ni mutu wanjina.’ ",
