              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, hura mkpwutano walavya madzina ga atu airi; mmwenga ni Yusufu Barisaba ambaye piya kala achiihwa Justo na wanjina kala ni Mathiasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achivoya Mlungu, achiamba, “Mlungu umanyaye roho ya chila mutu, hunakuvoya uhuonyese hinya alume airi, ni yuphi uchiyemtsambula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili ahale nafwasi ya kazi ya utume yorichwa ni Juda, na achiphiya kpwahali komuajira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu apiga kura, na kura ichimgbwerera Mathiasi. Naye achitiywa kundi ra hara mitume anjina kumi na mmwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.1.26",
